sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant A as API/use case
  participant D as Database
  participant W as Publish worker
  participant Y as YouTube

  C->>A: POST publication + Idempotency-Key
  A->>D: TX: key+fingerprint, intent, job, outbox
  D-->>A: publication/job IDs
  A-->>C: 202 Accepted
  W->>D: claim fenced lease by channel
  W->>D: recheck approval, hashes, credential, intent
  W->>D: mark provider_pending + unique marker
  W->>Y: videos.insert(marker, resumable upload)
  alt response received
    Y-->>W: videoId + requestId
    W->>D: checkpoint videoId before later mutations
  else timeout or crash before checkpoint
    W->>D: lease expires; state provider_unknown
    W->>Y: reconcile channel by marker/fingerprint/window
    alt exactly one match
      Y-->>W: existing videoId
      W->>D: bind videoId; continue
    else no safe unique match
      W->>D: reconciliation_required; block retry
    end
  end
  W->>Y: thumbnail / playlists (checkpoint each)
  W->>D: TX: succeeded + audit + outbox
